    "Apply mean reversion bias: if 30-day forecast is >75.00 and true outcome is <72.00, reduce next forecast by 3–5%.",
    "If sentiment history shows a 0.33 (positive signal) but model forecast is consistently below true outcome, increase forecast by 2–4% to align with sentiment.",
    "For horizon >15 days, reduce forecast volatility by smoothing out extreme deviations (±10% from recent 7-day average)."
